{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525750/extras/c8dd6c874f91e34d3f9e77d7f1bbce85.poster.avif?t=1758920154\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525750/extras/c8dd6c874f91e34d3f9e77d7f1bbce85.webm?t=1758920154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525750/extras/c8dd6c874f91e34d3f9e77d7f1bbce85.mp4?t=1758920154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the announcement of a nuclear attack, the protagonist grabs what\u2019s necessary and races to an underground fallout shelter, trying to survive in a harsh, post-apocalyptic world. In this game, you will experience the brutal realities of survival, where every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525750/extras/38c8f28ed2fe92e3085cedfbb69b36f2.poster.avif?t=1758920154\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525750/extras/38c8f28ed2fe92e3085cedfbb69b36f2.webm?t=1758920154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525750/extras/38c8f28ed2fe92e3085cedfbb69b36f2.mp4?t=1758920154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Survival Mechanics:</strong><br>Manage food and water intake, as every item affects your health in different ways. Poor choices can lead to deteriorating mental health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mental Health System:</strong><br>Your psychological state is just as important as your physical health. Pay attention to your mental well-being by resting, taking medications, or listening to music. Neglecting this can lead to severe consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong><br>The shelter isn\u2019t as small as it seems. Explore every corner to find resources, hidden secrets, and essential items that could be the difference between life and death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuel Management:</strong><br>Keep the shelter\u2019s generator running by finding and using fuel. Without it, the shelter\u2019s systems could fail, leaving you in the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintenance:</strong><br>The flashlight\u2019s battery life and other important devices need regular attention. Make sure you have replacements when necessary, or face the consequences of malfunctioning equipment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525750/extras/ff30a1cc077dea62f2879921b5130263.poster.avif?t=1758920154\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525750/extras/ff30a1cc077dea62f2879921b5130263.webm?t=1758920154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525750/extras/ff30a1cc077dea62f2879921b5130263.mp4?t=1758920154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food and Water Impact:</strong><br>Each food or drink item affects your health differently. Pay attention to what you eat to avoid health issues that can affect your survival chances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music for Sanity:</strong><br>Listening to music helps maintain your sanity. Explore the shelter to find radios or other devices that can play tunes, keeping your mind intact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deteriorating Environment:</strong><br>Time is a critical factor. As you stay in the shelter, your supplies and energy will dwindle. You must constantly adapt and make smart choices to stay alive.</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525750?t=1758920154","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525750?t=1758920154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525750/a6b3f33e47752b606f5a27105aed85fb55c5a59d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758920154","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525750/a6b3f33e47752b606f5a27105aed85fb55c5a59d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758920154","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525750/extras/c8dd6c874f91e34d3f9e77d7f1bbce85.poster.avif?t=1758920154\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525750/extras/c8dd6c874f91e34d3f9e77d7f1bbce85.webm?t=1758920154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525750/extras/c8dd6c874f91e34d3f9e77d7f1bbce85.mp4?t=1758920154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the announcement of a nuclear attack, the protagonist grabs what\u2019s n